{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/479272-character-concept-help","id":479272,"title":"Character Concept Help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-13T10:59:53-07:00","id":479272,"title":"Character Concept Help","content":"So I was thinking about a character who was basically Hansel and Greteled by his Keeper and his now mostly candy. What type of Seeming would that be? I was thinking maybe Elemental, but I don't know where they would fit in. Maybe something homebrewed? Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5682-saintmac","name":"SaintMac","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T11:17:06-07:00","id":479300,"title":"","content":"Probobly homebrewed, none quite work for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T11:46:03-07:00","id":479317,"title":"","content":"Keep in mind that appearance doesn't always dictate Kith/Seeming. Sure, you may think a catgirl is a Hunterheart Beast, until you find your wallet missing and realize she was a Larcenist Fairest. It will influence things of course but what your Changeling is is determined just as much by mental changes and experiences in Arcadia as by physical mutations.<br /> <br /> That said, I'd think they'd be an Ogre actually. Most likely a Gristlegrinder given the emphasis on eating. Witchtooth would be another good choice if they took on more aspects of their Keeper and the fact that witchtooths tend to be the 'clever' Ogre and cleverness was how Hansel and Gretel escaped in the original story. Well, part cleverness and part pushing the witch into an oven. Very Ogreish.<br /> <br /> There's not a kith in Elementals that fits them to a T, so you would probably be stretching the kith a bit to fit them. Sandharrowed (made of lots of little bits of candy), Earthbones (rock candy :P), Manakin (candy is a humanmade object); or Blightbent (my favorite option actually. Candy has preservatives and artificial sweeteners and isn't really the best for you. Plus the idea of touching someone gives them an unhealthy dose of sugar is appealing to me for some reason)<br /> <br /> Finally there's Fairest. Being Fairest would shift the emphasis of the Durance a lot toward the amazing tastes and sensations experienced, while cutting back on the whole prisoner of a hag witch. Might not be what you're looking for. Polychromatic definitely fits a person on a constant, multicolored candy, sugar rush though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2290-trickyboots","name":"TrickyBoots","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2290_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T12:23:40-07:00","id":479342,"title":"","content":"We had a Fairest with the concept in a game I ran. It was an NPC though so I did not worry really too much about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a 